  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "撮影、順調だな\r\nひとまずお疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はいっ、ありがとうございます♪",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっ\r\n千雪、楽しそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ……そ、そうでしょうか……？\r\nちょっと、その……舞い上がってしまいました……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "今日の撮影、セットも衣装もすごく素敵で……\r\n髪の毛にお花が咲いたのなんて初めてですし……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……まぁ、確かにそうかもな\r\n…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ、あの……？\r\nあんまりじっと見られると、恥ずかしいです……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あぁ、す、すまん\r\n……でも、すごく千雪らしいし、良い衣装だと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私らしい……\r\n……それなら、何よりです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ\r\nそれに、千雪がこんなに楽しんでくれてるんだから",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっと、この撮影は最後まで良いものになるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん。私、アイドルになってから\r\n今までよりもずっと色んなことを楽しめている気がします",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020080"
  },
  {
    "select": "スイカとか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "今回の衣装もな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "知り合いが\r\n増えたからかな？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020090,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい……！\r\n覚えていてくださったんですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ\r\nスイカを食べてる千雪、ずいぶんと楽しそうだったからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、今までの私だったら\r\nあんなこと、考えなかったと思います",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "子どもの頃は、あんなにたくさんのことに\r\n憧れを持っていたはずなのに",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "いざ大人になると、\r\n忘れてしまったり、諦めてしまったりして……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、千雪はやりたいことに挑戦しているだろう\r\nそういうところ、俺はすごいと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そんな……私が今、そう見えているのなら……\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげなんですよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい、何事もやってみなければわからない\r\nなんて当たり前のことを思えるようになったのも──",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが\r\n私とアイドルを引き合わせてくれたから、なんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、いや……そんなこと……\r\n……大げさだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020150,
    "speaker": "千雪＆プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020151"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "──あ、もう撮影が始まるみたいですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか\r\n……休憩、ちょっと短かったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……はい。……でも、充分リフレッシュになりました\r\nそれじゃあ、行ってきますね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ\r\n残りの撮影も……楽しんでな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はいっ、そうなんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "アイドルになる前は、こんなふうに\r\n自分を着飾ることなんてありませんでしたから",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか？　千雪は俺が初めて会った時から\r\n綺麗だったけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そ、そうでしょうか……？\r\n…………でも",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "自分がこんなに可愛らしい服を着るとか、誰かに\r\n選んでもらうとか、誰かのためにお洒落をするとか……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そういうの、\r\n考えたこともなかったんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "だから私、今はアイドルとして、女の子として……\r\nそういった楽しさをもっともっと味わいたくって",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！\r\n……千雪……やっぱり──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "──あ\r\n撮影再開、みたいですね",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……お、そうか\r\n行けるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020250,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ、ちょっと待ってください\r\n……ん、と……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "よしっ\r\nプロデューサーさん。衣装、乱れてませんよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ\r\nバッチリ決まってるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020270,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ、ありがとうございます\r\nそれでは、行ってきますねっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020270"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "se": "0113",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（千雪……やっぱりその笑顔は、初対面の時と同じだ\r\n……変わらずずっと、魅力的な人だよ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（俺も……千雪の笑顔をもっともっとたくさんの人に\r\n届けられるよう、頑張っていかないと！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、千雪のまわりには……\r\n個性豊かな面々がいて、毎日が刺激的だろう",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020280,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうですね……確かに、妹みたいな子たちと\r\nたくさんお話して、色々なことを教えてもらって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020290,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そして、気付かなかったことに気付いたりして……\r\nふふ、とっても楽しい生活です",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは良かった\r\nみんなにとっても、千雪の存在は刺激になっていると思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020300,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうでしょうか……！\r\nだったら、嬉しいです",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020310,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……私、本当に、今の環境は\r\nかけがえのないものだなって思ってます",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020320,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それも……あの日\r\nプロデューサーさんに出会えたからで──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020330,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "だから、私……\r\n運命なんじゃないかって思うんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……運命……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020340,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ、えっと、みんなに……\r\n……プロデューサーさんに、出会えたこと……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020350,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それに……今この場所に立てていること……とか\r\nそういう全部が、です",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600502/2016005020350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか\r\n千雪がそう思ってくれているのなら──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016005020360,
    "speaker": "千雪",
